 "verdicts": {
  "The Attractor specification sets a default retry backoff that starts at 200 ms, doubles up to a 60-second cap, and adds jitter. Transient network errors, HTTP 429 and 5xx failures are retryable by default, while authentication, 400, validation and configuration errors are not.": 1
